{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Buies": 17,
    "Player": 3
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7152201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Buies",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715220101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715220101": {
            "id": "715220101",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "This type of game sure is inspiring, hahaha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220102"
            ]
          },
          "715220102": {
            "id": "715220102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What new game?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220103"
            ]
          },
          "715220103": {
            "id": "715220103",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "Traveler! Good timing! I happen to need someone to playtest my new game.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220104"
            ]
          },
          "715220104": {
            "id": "715220104",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "Look here. I'm calling this game \"Inspiration Eruption.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220105"
            ]
          },
          "715220105": {
            "id": "715220105",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "It perfectly captures the entire process of how we poets create poetry!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220106"
            ]
          },
          "715220106": {
            "id": "715220106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You mean drinking, drinking, and more drinking?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220107"
            ]
          },
          "715220107": {
            "id": "715220107",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "Hahaha, hilarious. Though using wine to let one's creative juices flow is certainly a good idea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220108"
            ]
          },
          "715220108": {
            "id": "715220108",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "However, wine alone is not enough to inspire truly extraordinary poetry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220110"
            ]
          },
          "715220110": {
            "id": "715220110",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "Before we write a poem, we have to start by seeking out inspiration.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220111"
            ]
          },
          "715220111": {
            "id": "715220111",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "Some like to travel, some prefer solitude, while others... really enjoy using wine to stimulate their creativity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220112"
            ]
          },
          "715220112": {
            "id": "715220112",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "This is the most challenging part, since we cannot pinpoint where inspiration lies.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220113"
            ]
          },
          "715220113": {
            "id": "715220113",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "So most of the time we feel like we haven't found our muse, and become anxious and depressed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220114"
            ]
          },
          "715220114": {
            "id": "715220114",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "But in truth, inspiration has already visited us and left its mark inside our heads without us ever knowing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220115"
            ]
          },
          "715220115": {
            "id": "715220115",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "At the right juncture, they will come bursting out and take the form of a great poem... or a painting... or something else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220116"
            ]
          },
          "715220116": {
            "id": "715220116",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And you can turn all that into a game?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220117"
            ]
          },
          "715220117": {
            "id": "715220117",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "Hahaha! Of course! The process of making poetry is quite clear and easily understood.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220118"
            ]
          },
          "715220118": {
            "id": "715220118",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "It just so happens that there are a few tabletop game designers in Mondstadt interested in my ideas.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220119"
            ]
          },
          "715220119": {
            "id": "715220119",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "After some discussions and a few brainstorming sessions, we finally came up with \"Inspiration Eruption\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220120"
            ]
          },
          "715220120": {
            "id": "715220120",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "You can try it right now if you're interested.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715220121"
            ]
          },
          "715220121": {
            "id": "715220121",
            "speakerId": 30425,
            "speakerName": "Buies",
            "text": "Play a few rounds, and maybe you'll become a poet yourself!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}